OL,3,GNEWSA'Middle-aged men' began brawl on
OL,4,Abusy train
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree "middle-aged men" who began a
OL,7,Fdrunken brawl on a busy train full of
OL,8,Ffamilies and football fans should have
OL,9,Fknown better, a judge has said.
OL,11,FBrothers Thomas and Wayne Hawthorn, 59
OL,12,Fand 55, and their friend Jason Rodden,
OL,13,F55, exchanged punches with a group of
OL,14,FSunderland fans on the 20:00 London to
OL,15,FNewcastle train on 16 September 2023,
OL,16,FTeesside Crown Court heard.
OL,18,FThe melee began after Thomas Hawthorn,
OL,19,Fwho had boarded the train at York,
OL,20,Frepeatedly threw crisps at a group of
OL,21,Fmen, the court heard.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
