OL,3,GNEWSA'Middle-aged men' began brawl on
OL,4,Abusy train
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe brothers admitted affray while
OL,7,FRodden was convicted of the offence by
OL,8,Fjurors. The trio from Newcastle were
OL,9,Fgiven community orders with unpaid
OL,10,Fwork.
